05:39:53.861 --> 05:39:55.211
is 0s and 1s.

05:39:55.211 --> 05:39:57.321
We're just learning,
now, how to harness those

05:39:57.321 --> 05:40:01.481
and how to manipulate them ourselves.

05:40:01.481 --> 05:40:05.771
Any questions here on this?

05:40:05.771 --> 05:40:07.566
