07:34:25.941 --> 07:34:28.151
But this time, we need
eight people if we may.

07:34:28.151 --> 07:34:30.651
All of you have to be comfortable
appearing on the internet.

07:34:30.651 --> 07:34:33.526
OK, so this is actually quite
convenient that you're all quite close.

07:34:33.526 --> 07:34:37.113
How about 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7--

07:34:37.113 --> 07:34:41.421
oh, OK, and someone volunteering
their friend-- number eight.

07:34:41.421 --> 07:34:42.381
Come on down.

07:34:42.381 --> 07:34:43.236
Come on down.

07:34:43.236 --> 07:34:45.111
And if you could, I'm
going to set things up.

07:34:45.111 --> 07:34:47.991
If you all could join Valerie,
my colleague over there,

07:34:47.991 --> 07:34:53.271
to give you a prop to use here,
we'll go ahead in just a moment

07:34:53.271 --> 07:34:56.196
and try to find some numbers at hand.

