In just a moment, each of our volunteers
is going to be representing an integer.

07:35:05.181 --> 07:35:09.741
And that integer is initially
going to be in unsorted order.

07:35:09.741 --> 07:35:13.461
And I claim that using an algorithm,
step by step instructions,

07:35:13.461 --> 07:35:18.181
we can probably sort these folks in
at least a couple of different ways.

07:35:18.181 --> 07:35:22.791
So they're in wardrobe right now just
