07:35:22.791 --> 07:35:27.306
with a Jersey number on it, which will
then represent an element of our array.

07:35:31.011 --> 07:35:35.631
Give us just a moment to finish
getting the attire ready.

07:35:35.631 --> 07:35:40.401
They're being handed
a shirt and a number.

07:35:40.401 --> 07:35:42.981
And let me ask the
