07:35:42.981 --> 07:35:47.121
As we have these numbers up here on the
screen, these numbers too are unsorted.

07:35:47.121 --> 07:35:48.714
They're just in random order.

07:35:48.714 --> 07:35:49.881
And let me ask the audience.

07:35:49.881 --> 07:35:55.341
How would you go about sorting
these eight numbers on the screen?

07:35:55.341 --> 07:35:57.291
How would you go about sorting these?

07:35:57.291 --> 07:35:58.499
Yeah, what are your thoughts?

07:35:58.499 --> 07:36:04.688
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE] the number
