07:36:08.908 --> 07:36:09.491
DAVID J. MALAN: OK.

07:36:09.491 --> 07:36:11.161
AUDIENCE: If not, then [INAUDIBLE].

07:36:11.161 --> 07:36:13.713
DAVID J. MALAN: OK, so just
to recap, you would start

07:36:13.713 --> 07:36:15.171
