07:37:25.181 --> 07:37:26.231
So seven-- let's see.

07:37:26.231 --> 07:37:28.531
5, 2, 7, 4--

07:37:28.531 --> 07:37:29.451
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE]

07:37:29.451 --> 07:37:31.094
DAVID J. MALAN: 4, hopefully 1.

07:37:31.094 --> 07:37:32.261
Yeah, keep them to the side.

07:37:32.261 --> 07:37:35.571
OK, 1, 6, and there we go--

07:37:35.571 --> 07:37:36.071
3.

07:37:36.071 --> 07:37:36.904
Come on over, three.

