08:41:25.692 --> 08:41:32.775
but maybe an R, a G, and a B value--
like 24 bits, or three bytes in total--

08:41:32.775 --> 08:41:33.942
but we'll come back to that.

08:41:33.942 --> 08:41:35.650
That would just be a
