10:43:56.872 --> 10:43:58.882
is that I could have had a return value.

10:43:58.882 --> 10:44:01.102
I could go in there
and change void to int,

10:44:01.102 --> 10:44:02.872
but which one am I going to return?

10:44:02.872 --> 10:44:04.582
The A or the B?

10:44:04.582 --> 10:44:06.992
The whole goal is to
swap two values, and it

10:44:06.992 --> 10:44:08.992
