11:12:33.534 --> 11:12:35.742
Because you might just get
lucky, and boom the number

11:12:35.742 --> 11:12:38.292
you're looking for is right there in
the middle, if using binary search.

11:12:38.292 --> 11:12:40.152
Or even linear search, for that matter.

11:12:40.152 --> 11:12:41.202
And insert 2.

11:12:41.202 --> 11:12:45.192
