13:16:54.512 --> 13:16:58.322
DAVID J. MALAN: All right, this is
CS50, and this is already week 6.

13:16:58.322 --> 13:17:00.980
And this is the week in which
you learn yet another language.

13:17:00.980 --> 13:17:03.272
But the goal is not just to
teach you another language,

13:17:03.272 --> 13:17:06.002
for languages sake,
as we transition today

13:17:06.002 --> 13:17:09.302
and in the coming weeks from C, where
we've spent the past several weeks, now

13:17:09.302 --> 13:17:09.962
to Python.

13:17:09.962 --> 13:17:14.052
The goal ultimately is to teach you all
