13:17:29.972 --> 13:17:31.832
of other aspects of
programming languages,

13:17:31.832 --> 13:17:34.532
like object-oriented
programming, and more.

13:17:34.532 --> 13:17:36.702
So recall, though, back
in week zero, Hello, world

13:17:36.702 --> 13:17:38.202
looked a little something like this.

13:17:38.202 --> 13:17:39.909
And the world was quite simple.

13:17:39.909 --> 13:17:42.242
All you had to do was drag
and drop these puzzle pieces.

13:17:42.242 --> 13:17:45.482
But there were still functions and
conditionals and loops and variables

13:17:45.482 --> 13:17:47.552
and all of those kinds of primitives.

13:17:47.552 --> 13:17:50.822
We then transitioned, of course,
to a much more arcane language that

13:17:50.822 --> 13:17:52.362
looked a little something like this.

13:17:52.362 --> 13:17:54.320
And even now, some weeks
later, you might still

13:17:54.320 --> 13:17:56.992
be struggling with some of the
