13:52:25.192 --> 13:52:28.142
I'm actually treating the dictionary
as something simpler, a set.

13:52:28.142 --> 13:52:31.942
So I'm going to make one tweak, set
recall was another data type in Python.

13:52:31.942 --> 13:52:34.222
But set just allows it
to handle duplicates,

13:52:34.222 --> 13:52:36.952
and it allows me to just throw
