14:28:19.792 --> 14:28:23.602
Python, underneath the hood, is
handling all of the memory management

14:28:23.602 --> 14:28:25.072
and the pointers and all of that.

14:28:25.072 --> 14:28:27.562
There are no pointers in Python.

14:28:27.562 --> 14:28:32.362
So If that wasn't clear, all of that
pain, if you will, all of that power,

14:28:32.362 --> 14:28:36.802
is now handled by the language
itself, not by us, the programmers.

