this loop, between lines 8 through 11.

14:42:20.772 --> 14:42:23.802
But n is actually still
in scope in Python.

14:42:23.802 --> 14:42:26.902
The moment you create a variable
in Python, for better or for worse,

14:42:26.902 --> 14:42:30.282
It is available everywhere within
that function, even outside

14:42:30.282 --> 14:42:32.212
