a question mark four times?

14:50:15.722 --> 14:50:19.902
Python, whoops, Python of
Mario.py, that also works.

14:50:19.902 --> 14:50:23.072
So it turns out that, just like
the plus operator in Python

14:50:23.072 --> 14:50:27.092
can join things together,
the multiply operator is not

14:50:27.092 --> 14:50:28.362
arithmetic in this case.

14:50:28.362 --> 14:50:32.592
It actually means, take this and
concatenate it four times over.

14:50:32.592 --> 14:50:35.522
So that's a way of just
distilling into one line what

14:50:35.522 --> 14:50:39.272
would have otherwise taken multiple
lines in C, fewer, but still multiple

14:50:39.272 --> 14:50:43.652
lines in Python, but is really
now rather succinct in Python,

14:50:43.652 --> 14:50:44.907
by doing that instead.

