own, which is kind of silly.

15:01:03.292 --> 15:01:07.852
But it's necessary, so that this
thing and this thing are both lists.

15:01:07.852 --> 15:01:10.492
To do this more verbosely,
which most programmers wouldn't

15:01:10.492 --> 15:01:12.832
do, but just for clarity,
this is the same thing

15:01:12.832 --> 15:01:15.472
as saying scores plus this score.

15:01:15.472 --> 15:01:19.432
So now maybe it's a little more
clear that scores and brackets score

15:01:19.432 --> 15:01:24.202
plural, sorry, singular, are both
lists themselves, being concatenated

15:01:24.202 --> 15:01:25.382
or joined together.

15:01:25.382 --> 15:01:28.262
So two different ways, not sure
one is better than the other.

15:01:28.262 --> 15:01:34.162
This way is pretty common, but .append
