15:04:03.872 --> 15:04:05.282
There's only strings, anyway.

15:04:05.282 --> 15:04:07.122
So I might as well do them all at once.

15:04:07.122 --> 15:04:10.742
So if I rerun the code now,
Python of Uppercase.py.

15:04:10.742 --> 15:04:15.602
Now I'll type in Hello in all
