15:05:39.552 --> 15:05:43.272
to take input from the user, whoops.

15:05:43.272 --> 15:05:46.792
So we could actually take input
from the user at the command line,

15:05:46.792 --> 15:05:49.732
so as to take literally
command line arguments.

15:05:49.732 --> 15:05:52.542
These are a little different,
