15:06:24.342 --> 15:06:26.572
after the program's
name, or none at all.

15:06:26.572 --> 15:06:33.192
So if the length of argv equals 2,
let's go ahead and print out, how about,

15:06:33.192 --> 15:06:41.610
Hello comma argv bracket 1 close quote,
else if they don't type two words

15:06:41.610 --> 15:06:44.652
total at the prompt, let's just say
