15:35:06.102 --> 15:35:08.462
And then, using these
lines of code here,

15:35:08.462 --> 15:35:11.356
I'm using that image library,
to just draw a box, essentially.

15:35:11.356 --> 15:35:12.481
And the code looks cryptic.

15:35:12.481 --> 15:35:14.672
Honestly, I would have to look
this up to write it again.

15:35:14.672 --> 15:35:17.172
But per the documentation, this
just draws a nice little box

15:35:17.172 --> 15:35:18.132
around the image.

15:35:18.132 --> 15:35:24.722
So let me go ahead and zoom out here,
and run this now on Office.jpeg.

15:35:24.722 --> 15:35:29.912
All right, it's analyzing, analyzing,
and you can see in the sidebar here,

15:35:29.912 --> 15:35:30.902
here's the original.

15:35:30.902 --> 15:35:35.702
And here is every face that my,
