15:35:37.262 --> 15:35:37.932
What's a face?

15:35:37.932 --> 15:35:40.712
Presumably the library
is looking for something,

15:35:40.712 --> 15:35:43.622
maybe without a mask, that has
two eyes, a nose, and a mouth,

15:35:43.622 --> 15:35:45.942
in some kind of arrangement,
