16:04:39.952 --> 16:04:42.782
because the key you're trying
to use just doesn't exist yet.

16:04:42.782 --> 16:04:46.342
So logically, how could we fix this?

16:04:46.342 --> 16:04:47.032
We're close.

16:04:47.032 --> 16:04:50.452
We got half of the problem solved,
