16:04:50.452 --> 16:04:52.192
case of nothing being there.

16:04:52.192 --> 16:04:52.937
Yeah?

16:04:52.937 --> 16:04:54.272
AUDIENCE: Creating a counter.

16:04:54.272 --> 16:04:54.962
DAVID J. MALAN: Creating a--

16:04:54.962 --> 16:04:55.712
AUDIENCE: Counter.

16:04:55.712 --> 16:04:57.582
DAVID J. MALAN: Creating
