16:05:17.582 --> 16:05:22.082
And recall, this is just shorthand
notation for the same thing as in C,

16:05:22.082 --> 16:05:23.642
title plus 1.

16:05:23.642 --> 16:05:24.702
Whoops, typo.

16:05:24.702 --> 16:05:25.510
Don't do that.

16:05:25.510 --> 16:05:28.052
That's the same thing as this
