16:14:51.782 --> 16:14:54.602
It's really meant for one
line of code, generally.

16:14:54.602 --> 16:14:56.762
So you don't use the return keyword.

16:14:56.762 --> 16:14:59.222
You just say what it
is you want to return.

16:14:59.222 --> 16:15:03.022
