16:19:55.702 --> 16:19:58.375
very specific as a short
text answer like this,

16:19:58.375 --> 16:20:01.042
you might know that there's toggles
like this in Google's world,

16:20:01.042 --> 16:20:02.272
like you can require it.

16:20:02.272 --> 16:20:04.612
Or you can do response validation.

16:20:04.612 --> 16:20:07.012
You could say, what's your email?

