16:48:45.752 --> 16:48:49.802
How did I do that accidentally?

16:48:49.802 --> 16:48:50.942
What did I do wrong?

16:48:50.942 --> 16:48:55.576
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE]

16:48:55.576 --> 16:48:56.451
DAVID J. MALAN: Yeah.

16:48:56.451 --> 16:48:57.802
So beware, this is funny.

16:48:57.802 --> 16:48:59.701
