16:48:59.701 --> 16:49:03.152
So the SQL database took me--
literally, I updated favorites,

16:49:03.152 --> 16:49:06.352
setting genres equal to that,
semicolon, end of thought.

16:49:06.352 --> 16:49:08.842
I really wanted to say
where title equals,

16:49:08.842 --> 16:49:11.362
quote, unquote, "Game of Thrones."

16:49:11.362 --> 16:49:14.422
Unfortunately, there isn't an
