17:10:29.032 --> 17:10:33.522
It's doing a whole bunch of SQL
inserts to store in their database what

17:10:33.522 --> 17:10:34.632
it is you bought.

17:10:34.632 --> 17:10:37.602
There's other types of databases,
too, but SQL databases,

17:10:37.602 --> 17:10:39.989
or relational databases
are quite popular.

17:10:39.989 --> 17:10:42.072
So let's go ahead and write
