17:12:59.177 --> 17:13:01.552
So the goal at hand is to
actually write a program that's

17:13:01.552 --> 17:13:07.762
going to search favorites.csv, a.k.a.,
favorites.db for the total number

17:13:07.762 --> 17:13:10.642
of people that liked a particular show.

17:13:10.642 --> 17:13:14.392
So this is going to select the count
of people from the favorites table

17:13:14.392 --> 17:13:18.742
where the title they typed in is like
