20:04:41.982 --> 20:04:45.672
So if I reload now, OK,
it's just a little prettier.

20:04:45.672 --> 20:04:47.192
And now let me accelerate.

20:04:47.192 --> 20:04:50.672
Just to demonstrate how I can
take this home, let me go ahead

20:04:50.672 --> 20:04:55.232
and open up my premade
version of this, whereby

20:04:55.232 --> 20:04:58.862
I added to this some final flourishes.

20:04:58.862 --> 20:05:02.282
If I go to Search2.html, I
decided to replace their logo

20:05:02.282 --> 20:05:05.582
with just this out of a
cat, and notice that I

20:05:05.582 --> 20:05:07.665
re-implemented essentially google.com.

20:05:07.665 --> 20:05:10.082
Here's a text box, here's two
buttons, even though they're

20:05:10.082 --> 20:05:11.642
a little washed out on the screen.

20:05:11.642 --> 20:05:14.882
I even figured out how to get dots
