20:05:14.882 --> 20:05:18.422
And if we view source, you can see
how I kind of finished this code.

20:05:18.422 --> 20:05:25.322
If I go to view developer tools, and I
go to elements, and I go into this div,

20:05:25.322 --> 20:05:31.082
and I go into this div, you'll see
that here's an image tag for happy cat.

20:05:31.082 --> 20:05:35.532
And I added some classes there to make
