20:05:35.532 --> 20:05:38.652
If I go into the form tag, this
is the same form tag as before.

20:05:38.652 --> 20:05:40.952
But, notice, I used
button tags this time,

20:05:40.952 --> 20:05:43.672
with button and button light classes.

20:05:43.672 --> 20:05:45.962
And then I stylized
