what's called-- whoops.

20:54:25.422 --> 20:54:29.112
When you have greet question
mark name equals something,

20:54:29.112 --> 20:54:31.842
you actually are giving a value to name.

20:54:31.842 --> 20:54:34.482
It is quote unquote
with nothing in between.

20:54:34.482 --> 20:54:36.952
That is different from
having no value at all.

20:54:36.952 --> 20:54:40.965
So allow me to just propose
that the error here, we

20:54:40.965 --> 20:54:42.882
would want to require
this in a different way.

20:54:42.882 --> 20:54:45.372
And probably the most
robust way to do this

20:54:45.372 --> 20:54:51.022
