for something we'll be

20:55:05.502 --> 20:55:08.232
doing in the next problem set
in terms of error checking,

20:55:08.232 --> 20:55:14.772
you should never, ever, ever rely on
client side safety checks like this.

20:55:14.772 --> 20:55:19.302
Because we know, from last week, that
