20:55:26.662 --> 20:55:29.722
You can just delete what's
in the dom, in the browser,

20:55:29.722 --> 20:55:32.682
and now I can go ahead
and submit this form.

20:55:32.682 --> 20:55:34.272
And it appears to be broken.

20:55:34.272 --> 20:55:37.462
Not a big deal with a silly little
