20:55:37.462 --> 20:55:40.512
But if you're trying to
require that humans actually

20:55:40.512 --> 20:55:43.902
provide input that is necessary for
the correct operation of the site,

20:55:43.902 --> 20:55:49.452
you don't want to trust that the HTML
is not altered by some adversary.

