these components communicating with one

21:13:52.312 --> 21:13:55.222
another is representative of
how a lot of frameworks work.

21:13:55.222 --> 21:13:58.792
What we're teaching today, this week,
is not really specific to Python.

21:13:58.792 --> 21:14:01.582
