21:52:47.232 --> 21:52:49.362
But what if the user is
not typing anything in,

21:52:49.362 --> 21:52:51.552
they're just clicking a button?

21:52:51.552 --> 21:52:53.422
Well, watch this.

21:52:53.422 --> 21:52:55.897
Let me go ahead and
