21:58:47.722 --> 21:58:51.222
This is the syntax for that.
app.config is a special dictionary that

21:58:51.222 --> 21:58:55.602
comes with Flask that is automatically
created when you create the app appear

21:58:55.602 --> 21:58:58.962
