21:58:58.962 --> 21:59:01.482
values for the default
sender address that I

21:59:01.482 --> 21:59:05.472
want to send email as, the default
password I want to use to send email,

21:59:05.472 --> 21:59:08.652
the port number, the TCP port,
that we talked about last week.

21:59:08.652 --> 21:59:12.492
The mail server, I'm going to use
Gmail's smtp.gmail.com server.

21:59:12.492 --> 21:59:14.532
Use TLS, this means use encryption.

21:59:14.532 --> 21:59:15.672
So I set that to true.

21:59:15.672 --> 21:59:18.562
Mail username, this is going
to grab it from my environment.

21:59:18.562 --> 21:59:21.972
So for security purposes, I didn't
want to hard code my own Gmail username

21:59:21.972 --> 21:59:24.024
and password into the code.

21:59:24.024 --> 21:59:26.982
So I'm actually storing those in what
are called environment variables.

21:59:26.982 --> 21:59:29.112
You'll see more of these
in problem set nine,

21:59:29.112 --> 21:59:31.122
and it's a very common
convention on a server

21:59:31.122 --> 21:59:36.772
in the real world to store sensitive
information in the computer's memory

21:59:36.772 --> 21:59:39.642
so that it can be accessed
when your website is running,

21:59:39.642 --> 21:59:41.202
but not in your source code.

21:59:41.202 --> 21:59:44.232
It's way too easy if
you put credentials,

21:59:44.232 --> 21:59:47.532
sensitive stuff in your source
code, to post it to GitHub

21:59:47.532 --> 21:59:50.832
or to screenshot it accidentally,
or for information to leak out.

21:59:50.832 --> 21:59:55.962
So for today's purposes, know that the
OS.environ dictionary refers to what

21:59:55.962 --> 21:59:57.582
are called environment variables.

21:59:57.582 --> 22:00:01.092
And this is like an out-of-band, a
special way of defining key value

22:00:01.092 --> 22:00:04.122
pairs in the computer's memory
by running a certain command

22:00:04.122 --> 22:00:06.492
but that never show up
in your actual code.

22:00:06.492 --> 22:00:09.132
Otherwise, there would be so
many usernames and passwords

22:00:09.132 --> 22:00:11.922
accidentally visible on the internet.

